      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 3.41,
          "en": "Now, to get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.41,
          "end": 5.12,
          "en": "with push notifications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.12,
          "end": 8.58,
          "en": "I always recommend diving into the official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.58,
          "end": 11.42,
          "en": "of the tool you're using as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.42,
          "end": 13.16,
          "en": "I'm going to show you all steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.16,
          "end": 14.77,
          "en": "throughout the next lectures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.77,
          "end": 16.11,
          "en": "but still, it's a good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.11,
          "end": 18.8,
          "en": "to search for Expo push notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.8,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "so that you find their documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 23.19,
          "en": "where you get detailed instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.19,
          "end": 26.553,
          "en": "on how to send and handle push notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.53,
          "end": 30.95,
          "en": "At the moment, this is split across multiple articles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.95,
          "end": 33.8,
          "en": "which talk about setting everything up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.8,
          "end": 35.84,
          "en": "for sending push notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.84,
          "end": 40.25,
          "en": "and then how you need to send push notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.25,
          "end": 44.47,
          "en": "Here you also find examples and instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.47,
          "end": 47.5,
          "en": "for how you would trigger that from some backend code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.5,
          "end": 49.83,
          "en": "so how you could send push notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.83,
          "end": 52.343,
          "en": "from your backend code if you had a backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.18,
          "end": 57.59,
          "en": "But you also find a URL, an API endpoint",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.59,
          "end": 60.59,
          "en": "to which you can send requests from inside your app code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.59,
          "end": 63.31,
          "en": "for example, to deliver push notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.31,
          "end": 65.44,
          "en": "to other devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.44,
          "end": 67.23,
          "en": "But again, we're going to go through all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 70.773,
          "en": "of that step by step throughout this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.74,
          "end": 75.18,
          "en": "And of course, it all starts with the setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.18,
          "end": 78.03999999999999,
          "en": "Now, you need the Expo Notifications package installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.03999999999999,
          "end": 80,
          "en": "because we will still use that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80,
          "end": 83.83,
          "en": "But now we will also need to do a couple of other things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.83,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "For example, we will need to request permissions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 88.5,
          "en": "at least for iOS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.5,
          "end": 91.78999999999999,
          "en": "and we will need to get a so-called ExpoPushToken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.97999999999999,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "which will then act as the address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 98.35,
          "en": "to which we wanna send a push notification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.35,
          "end": 99.82,
          "en": "as you will see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.82,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "So let's now go through these setup steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 105.14,
          "en": "and we find some helpful code snippets down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.14,
          "end": 107.31,
          "en": "These snippets actually even check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 110.41,
          "en": "for whether the app is running on an emulator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.41,
          "end": 113.83,
          "en": "or a real device because now for push notifications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.83,
          "end": 116.88,
          "en": "we will need a real device to test them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "That's why we have this extra if check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 121.91,
          "en": "to check whether the code is running on a real device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.91,
          "end": 123.42,
          "en": "or an emulator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.42,
          "end": 126.7,
          "en": "And only if it's a real device, it will continue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.7,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "I will not add this check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 131.12,
          "en": "but you should be aware that you can only test this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.12,
          "end": 134.123,
          "en": "on real devices through Expo's Go app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.2,
          "end": 138.7,
          "en": "Now, it all starts with getting such a push token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.7,
          "end": 141.13,
          "en": "and the push token is, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.13,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "simply a string that will be unique for every device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 148.78,
          "en": "So every device will get its own unique push token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.78,
          "end": 152.07,
          "en": "and therefore, this push token will be the address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.07,
          "end": 153.13,
          "en": "which we will need later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.13,
          "end": 157.46,
          "en": "when we send push notifications to other devices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.46,
          "end": 159.91,
          "en": "because, of course, if you think about it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.91,
          "end": 162.4,
          "en": "when it comes to delivering push notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.4,
          "end": 163.71,
          "en": "to other devices,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.71,
          "end": 167.43,
          "en": "you need some way of identifying devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.43,
          "end": 172.39,
          "en": "And the address of a device is simply such a push token,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.39,
          "end": 174.92000000000002,
          "en": "which will be unique for every device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.92000000000002,
          "end": 178.45,
          "en": "Hence, in our code, we need to get such a push token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.45,
          "end": 181.65,
          "en": "and it's up to you where you wanna get that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.65,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "You could maybe want to get that token only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 186.15,
          "en": "on a certain screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.15,
          "end": 189.02,
          "en": "or after the user clicked a certain button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.02,
          "end": 191.29,
          "en": "Here in this case, I will make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.29,
          "end": 193.63,
          "en": "that such a push token is fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.63,
          "end": 196.1,
          "en": "right when the app starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.1,
          "end": 197.563,
          "en": "So therefore, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.54,
          "end": 202.96,
          "en": "I will add another useEffect call in my App component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 202.96,
          "end": 206.21,
          "en": "and add my Effect function and its dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.21,
          "end": 207.84,
          "en": "And now in this Effect function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.84,
          "end": 209.773,
          "en": "I wanna get this push token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.99,
          "end": 214.57,
          "en": "So for this, we again need to use this Notifications package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.57,
          "end": 217.18,
          "en": "and on this Notifications object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.18,
          "end": 220.287,
          "en": "we can call getExpoPushTokenAsync.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 222.57999999999998,
          "end": 225.81,
          "en": "This is the method we must call to get this push token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 225.81,
          "end": 227.55,
          "en": "for this device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 227.55,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "And we will get a ExpoPushToken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 233.09,
          "en": "which we can use with Expo's push notifications server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 233.09,
          "end": 235.36,
          "en": "to be precise, which is that server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.36,
          "end": 237.22,
          "en": "to which we can send requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.22,
          "end": 239.86,
          "en": "to have push notifications delivered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.86,
          "end": 241.52,
          "en": "to multiple devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.52,
          "end": 244.303,
          "en": "So this server I mentioned on the slide before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 245.35,
          "end": 248.13,
          "en": "Now, this method here will return a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.13,
          "end": 249.88,
          "en": "which will eventually resolve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 249.88,
          "end": 252.16,
          "en": "to the push token for the device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 252.16,
          "end": 254.36,
          "en": "on which this app is running.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.36,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "And if the same app is running on multiple devices,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 260.61,
          "en": "every device will get its own unique push token, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 260.61,
          "end": 262.66,
          "en": "And since this returns a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 262.66,
          "end": 266.43,
          "en": "we can add then here or use async await",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 266.43,
          "end": 270.23,
          "en": "to well, get that data to which the promise resolved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 270.23,
          "end": 271.48,
          "en": "so to get this pushToken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 272.93,
          "end": 275.24,
          "en": "So here we will get our pushToken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 275.24,
          "end": 280.24,
          "en": "and we can then, for example, log this pushToken here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 280.46,
          "end": 284.03,
          "en": "We can console.log this pushToken inside of this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 284.03,
          "end": 287.35,
          "en": "which will be executed once the promise resolved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 287.35,
          "end": 290.4,
          "en": "To be precise, what we get here, is the pushToken data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 290.4,
          "end": 292.87,
          "en": "and in there, we will have the pushToken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 292.87,
          "end": 296.65,
          "en": "the actual token in some nested field as you will see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 296.65,
          "end": 299.73,
          "en": "However, as we saw before in the official Expo docs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 299.73,
          "end": 303.33,
          "en": "we won't be able to test this on our emulators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 303.33,
          "end": 306.19,
          "en": "because push notifications are not supported there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 306.19,
          "end": 308.72,
          "en": "We will need to test it on a real devices instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 308.72,
          "end": 310.793,
          "en": "and that is what we will do next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
